<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - STERIS started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - STERIS started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Ann Malone has started coverage of STERIS Corp with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Mentor, Ohio, infection prevention systems company closed Wednesday at 32-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
